<title>PORTUGAL: SOCCER-BOAVISTA BEAT PORTO 2-0 IN PORTUGUESE SUPERCUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BOAVISTA BEAT PORTO 2-0 IN PORTUGUESE SUPERCUP.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portuguese Cup holders</p>
<p>Boavista beat league champions Porto 2-0 (halftime 0-0) in the</p>
<p>first leg of the pre-season Portuguese Supercup on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Ayew Kwame 58, Ion Timofte 61</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
<p>Second leg to be played on September 10.</p>
</text>
